                <invention-title lang="fr">AFFICHEUR ÉLECTROLUMINESCENT ORGANIQUE COMPRENANT UN TRANSISTOR EN COUCHES MINCES DE DIVERS TYPES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ORGANIC LIGHT EMITTING DISPLAY DEVICE COMPRISING MULTI-TYPE THIN FILM TRANSISTOR</invention-title>
